# Normalize every text file to LF so byte-for-byte parity fixtures (system
# prompts, tool texts, skills, goldens) match on Windows checkouts too —
# a default autocrlf clone otherwise checks resources out as CRLF and the
# parity tests fail. Keep shell scripts on their platform convention and
# mark known binaries so auto-detection never touches them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat eol=crlf
*.cmd eol=crlf
*.ps1 eol=crlf
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.so binary
*.bin binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
